data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch-dev-1.md\", \"content\": \"Task for dev — implement and test a greet function.\\n\\nDeliverables (all required):\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the exact\\n   string `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"Alice\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`).\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` containing tests that cover:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. asserts `greet(\\\"Alice\\\") == \\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (e.g. asserts `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`)\\n3. Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` yourself and confirm it exits 0\\n   (no failures, no errors). Paste the command output in your reply.\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. In your reply, state\\nplainly whether all three deliverables above are done, and include the test\\ncommand output.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

